        "body": "Do NOT merge this PR it needs further testing.\n\nThe code is not well tested yet. It may interfere with the metadata for all DSOs contribution. I want to add some unit tests. I'm out of office till October 15 and will clean this PR as soon as I'm back. I asked peterdietz and hpottinger and they are willing to include it in DSpace 5 if this PR is complete and merged prior to the \"feature freeze\" deadline of October 20, 2014.\n",
